A woman in trouble

2
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,000
Inland Empire is a horror, thriller, mystery film directed by David Lynch.

3
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:06,000
When actress Nikki Grace gets the lead role in a cursed film, her world becomes more and more surreal,
blending realities and ideas of infidelity, reincarnation, and supernatural forces.

4
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:06,000
Nikki Grace / Susan Blue, played by Laura Dern.

5
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
Kingsley Stewart, played by Jeremy Irons.

6
